title Cassette: rewinding at 5x while playing: hubs clockwise fast, the 5x badge, REW and PLAY/PAUSE latched, REC unlatched (board CassetteWind)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO wind
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot wind
expect text "REW"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
